    {
      "text": "Dark-blue tile labelled “OE1” with a white abstract icon of four linked circles. Its text reads “Promover la colaboración en el plano mundial y fomentar la transferencia de conocimientos de salud digital” (promote global collaboration and advance the transfer of knowledge on digital health).",
